{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040210/extras/85f5df897631c8ff9722dbe9cfb71926.avif?t=1774609777\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040210/extras_big/85f5df897631c8ff9722dbe9cfb71926.webp?t=1774609777 width=1560 height=712 /></span><u><strong>The peaceful life of a potion brewing Cat witch</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Forage and Brew, play as a little Cat witch as she inherits the potion workshop of her grandmother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make potions to complete requests from clients all around this little world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Collect ingredients from Nature's will</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, the weather and the lunar cycle will change and in turn, different ingredients will appear in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through the woods, find ingredients all around the forest and collect them with your little paws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill in the magical grimoire that your grandmother has given you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Brew potions by following the recipes</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your workshop are all kinds of tools and utensils necessary to the preparation of your potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your ingredients and gather them up in the cauldron throughout different little activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your potions to complete requests from your clients.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Spend your <i>meowney</i></strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the money gained from the requests, choose what you want to buy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new areas in the forest and new instalations in your workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose among 14 clothing sets to match your tastes and foresty 